              <SubComponents>
                <Component class="javax.swing.JTextArea" name="txtHelp">
                  <Properties>
                    <Property name="editable" type="boolean" value="false"/>
                    <Property name="columns" type="int" value="20"/>
                    <Property name="lineWrap" type="boolean" value="true"/>
                    <Property name="rows" type="int" value="5"/>
                    <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="1. LOGIN&#xa;&#xa;Enter your registered username and password to access the&#xa;staff system.&#xa;&#xa;2. APPOINTMENT MANAGEMENT&#xa;&#xa;Use the Appointment section to register patient appointments.&#xa;Enter the patient&apos;s name, address, contact number, dentist,&#xa;treatment, appointment date and appointment time.&#xa;&#xa;3. SEARCH&#xa;&#xa;Use the Search section to find appointment or patient&#xa;information quickly.&#xa;&#xa;4. BILLING&#xa;&#xa;Use the Billing section to create and manage patient billing&#xa;information.&#xa;&#xa;5. REPORTS&#xa;&#xa;Use the Reports section to view appointment and other system&#xa;information required by the clinic.&#xa;&#xa;6. PATIENT INFORMATION&#xa;&#xa;Check that patient information is entered correctly before&#xa;saving any records.&#xa;&#xa;7. LOGOUT&#xa;&#xa;Always use the Logout option when you finish using the system.&#xa;You will be returned to the Login screen.&#xa;&#xa;If you experience a problem, contact the system administrator."/>
                    <Property name="wrapStyleWord" type="boolean" value="true"/>
                  </Properties>
                </Component>
              </SubComponents>
            </Container>
          </SubComponents>
        </Container>
